{
  "id": "JDG.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Jupoklembe 19",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre i ceng’ maeca, kinde m’ubimo mbe i Israel, nia Jalawi moko bedo ni umondo yor i wang’ ng’om gudi pa Efraim, m’egamu ire dhaku m’araga kud i Beth-lehem-yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhakune m’araga etimo tarwang’ ejai ko ire, man eweke ecidho ba ot pa won i Beth-lehem-yuda, man ebedo kuca nindo mi dwi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E cware ai, man elubo toke, kara enyebe, ekele kendo, nwang’u jatic pare ni kude, ku kana ario: man etere i ot pa won; man ka won nyaku nene, anyong’a nege kum girombo kude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jalkwaru mire, ma won nyaku, ucere; e ebedo kude ceng’ adek: kum kumeno gicamu man gimadhu, man givuto keca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre i ceng’ mir ang’wende, nia giai pir kugweno, man eai malu kara ecidhi: man won nyaku wacu ni jal wode kumae, Mi tego ni adundeni ku cemo moko, man yo ku ng’eye wubicidho mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno gibedo piny, man gicamu gimadhu de, gin ario karacelo: man won nyaku wacu ni ng’atuca kumae, Akwei, dong’ ebed ber iri ya ibed diewor soro, man wek anyong’a neg adundeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’atuca ai malu kara ecidhi; ento jalkwaru mire cung’e, man evuto keca kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eai malu pir kugweno i ceng’ mir abije kara ecidhi; man won nyaku wacu kumae, Akwei, mi tego ni adundeni, man ibed cil ma ceng’ upodho ko; e gicamu, gin ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka ng’atuca giai malu kara gicidhi, en, ku dhaku pare m’araga, man jatic pare, jalkwaru mire, ma won nyaku, wacu ire kumae, Nen, kawono ceng’ uvoc, akwei ibed ku diewor soro: nen, ceng’ umaku mwony, vut keni, kara anyong’a neg adundeni; man urwone Wucidh i yo mu pir kugweno, kara idok thu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ng’atuca yio ngo ebed ku diewor maeno, ento eai malu ecidho, manewok kum Yebus (ma en e Yerusalem): man kana ario ni kude m’ubedo ayika mi woth; dhaku pare m’araga bende ni karacelo kude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kinde ma giwok ceng’ni Yebus, ceng’ uvoc; e jatic uwacu ni jadit pare kumae, Akwei, bin, wek warob i adhura maeni mi Juyebusi, wavut i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jadit pare wacu ire kumae, Wabirobo ngo i adhura pa jawirok, ma en e mi nyithindho mir Israel ungo; ento wabikadhu lokaca i Gibeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ni jatic pare kumae, Bin wacor ceng’ni ka maeni moko m’i kindgi; man wabivuto i Gibeya, kadi i Rama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno gikadhu gicidho acidha; man ceng’ upodho i wigi nwang’u gini ceng’ni Gibeya, ma adhura pa Benyamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man girobo keca kara gimond givut i Gibeya: man emondo, e ebedo piny i gengi mir adhurane; kum ng’atu moko mbe m’ugamugi ya givut i ot pare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man, nen, ng’atu m’uti uai i tic pare m’i podho uthieno: nwang’u ng’atuca en e dhanu m’i ng’om gudi pa Efraim man ebedo ni umondo i Gibeya: ento dhanu ma keca gi Jubenyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eting’o wang’e, e eneno jawoth i gengi mir adhurane; man ng’atu m’uti wacu kumae, Icidho kani? man iai kani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ire kumae, Wabekadhu akadha ma waai ko i Beth-lehem-Yuda wabecidho yo ku ma bor m’i ng’om gudi pa Efraim; aai kuca man acidho Beth-lehem-Yuda: man kawono abecidho ba ot pa Yehova; man ng’atu moko mbe m’ugama i ot pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Karacelo ku maeni lum ku cemo nuti kudwa ni kana mwa; man kwen ku pigulok bende nuti ira, man ni bong’ peri, man ni jalawobi ma ni karacelo ku jutic peri: gin moko mbe ma cande nuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu m’uti wacu kumae, Kwiocwiny ubed i beng’i; ento wek gin m’urem iri ceke ubed i wia: ento kud ivut i gengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno ekele i ot pare, man emio cemo ni kana; man gilwoko tiendgi, man gicamu gimadhu de.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.5+GEN.19.6+GEN.19.7+GEN.19.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 19:5-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka gibenyayu mutoro i adundegi, nen, dhanu mir adhurane, ma gi dhanu moko ma rac, gitieko ot kingili, ma gidwong’o ko dhugola; man giyero ni won ot, ma ng’atu m’utine kumae, Wodh ng’atu m’ubino i ot peri woko, kara wang’eye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’atu maeno, ma won ot, ewok woko i bang’gi, man ewacu igi kumae, Ungo, juwada, akwayuwu, kud wutim gin ma rac ma kumeni; kum ng’atu maeni mondo i ot para, kud wutim kasegu maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, nyara ni keni en e nyaku ma sumba, man dhaku pa ng’atuno m’araga abiwodhogi woko kawono, wujwiggi, man wutim kugi gin ma wuneno ber i weng’wu: ento kud wutim kasegu ma kumeni kum ng’atu maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento dhanu maeni giwinjo ire ngo: kum kumeno ng’atuca maku dhaku m’araga pare, man ekele woko i bang’gi; man ging’eye, gitime rac diewor soro cil kugweno: man ka piny uru, giweke ecidhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dhakune lund ubino ka mombwa thumo, man epodho piny i dhugola pa ng’atuca ka ma rwoth pare ni i ie, cil ma piny ulero ko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E rwoth pare ai malu kugweno, man eyabu dhugola mi ot, e ewok woko kara ecidh i yo pare; man, nen, dhaku m’araga pare podho piny i dhugola mi ot, ku cinge wi the dhugola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
