        {
          "text": "Man kan ebino i ot pare, egamu pala, man emaku dhaku pare m’araga, man etong’o ie, ku ba cogone, wath apar wi ario, man eore ku ba kieu ceke mir Israel ngung’. ",
          "type": "text",
