        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, nia dhanu ceke m’uneno maeni giwacu kumae, Wagi gin ma kumeni fodutimbre ngo kadok anena de ugambre i ceng’ ma nyithindho mir Israel giidho ie kud i ng’om Misiri cil tin: wupid pire, wupor lembe, man wuyer.",
